<item><title>Lomé bulldozers clear traders’ stalls before 20 November deadline</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/tg/lome-bulldozers-clear-traders-stalls-before-20-november-02b625/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/tg/lome-bulldozers-clear-traders-stalls-before-20-november-02b625/</guid><category>Togo</category><description>Traders using pavements and public spaces had been told to leave by 20 November, but machinery began clearing the areas at the start of the month.</description><pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 06:15:26 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/tg/lome-bulldozers-clear-traders-stalls-before-20-november-02b625/share.jpg" length="42715" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/tg/lome-bulldozers-clear-traders-stalls-before-20-november-02b625/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
